  "body": "A lot of it gets cleaned up when we eventually do a gen 2 GC, but 44G seems a bit insane for a process which is essentially a glorified web server:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1389908/107452202-bdb88e80-6b40-11eb-8677-4e10e6ae5501.png)\r\n\r\nIt would be good to find out what is using that memory, with a view to either not using it in the first place, or making it easier to free so that it gets removed in a gen 0 or gen 1 GC.",
